@startuml

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Local Administrator" as Administrator
rectangle "Database System" as DB << System >>

rectangle "World Population Reporting System" {
    usecase "Produce District City Report" as UC_CityReport
    usecase "Validate District" as UC_Validate
    usecase "Query District City Data" as UC_QueryCities
    usecase "Sort Cities by Population" as UC_SortCities
    usecase "Display Error Message" as UC_Error
}

Administrator --> UC_CityReport

UC_CityReport .> UC_Validate : <<include>>
UC_CityReport .> UC_QueryCities : <<include>>
UC_CityReport .> UC_SortCities : <<include>>

UC_QueryCities --> DB

UC_CityReport <.. UC_Error : <<extend>>\n(Invalid District or\nDatabase Failure)

note right of UC_CityReport
  Generates a report of all
  cities in the selected district:
  - City Name
  - Population
  Sorted largest to smallest
end note

note bottom of UC_Error
  Triggered if the district
  is invalid, MySQL database
  is unreachable, or city
  data is missing
end note

@enduml